WEBVTT

00:00:55.540 --> 00:01:04.975
HP: (Ne Kinezce)

00:01:04.975 --> 00:01:07.487
YR: Problemi i vetem ishte qe ta maskoja

00:01:07.487 --> 00:01:09.037
me Kinezce Mandarin

00:01:09.037 --> 00:01:11.755
eshte qe di te them vec kete paragraf,

00:01:11.755 --> 00:01:13.534
te cilin e kam mesuar permendesh

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:16.204
kur isha per vizite ne Kine. (Te qeshura)

00:01:16.204 --> 00:01:20.092
Pra, e vetmja c'ka mund te bej eshte ti perserisja me tone te ndryshme

00:01:20.092 --> 00:01:21.952
dhe shpresoj qe mos kuptohej.

00:01:21.952 --> 00:01:27.301
(Te qeshura)

00:01:27.301 --> 00:01:31.481
HP: (Ne Kinezce)